1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.050
Your Highness, these are the territory's critical reports for the week. They need your personal review and signature.

2
00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:21.860
Just looking at these gives me a headache. I'm the future Empress. Why the hell would I waste my time on this petty crap? Don't bother me.

3
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:28.860
Your Highness, the Mock War is only three months away. Shouldn't we start training the troops now?

4
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:39.460
My Emerald Plains has the strongest defenses and the most elite knights in the Empire. Why would I need training?

5
00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:50.530
I heard Princess Sylvia and her people are messing around with some strange tools. She's been holding a bunch of blueprints nobody can understand.

6
00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:56.030
Let's go. I'm in a good mood today. Let's go see what's going on.

7
00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:19.460
Yeah.

8
00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:24.460
Hi Sylvia, thought you actually had some groundbreaking skills. Turns out you're just playing house with a bunch of refugees.

9
00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:28.460
Not enjoying your Emerald Plains and still coming here for an inspection.

10
00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:39.460
My territory is drowning in wealth. I could leave it to attendance and still win easily. Not like you actually having to get your hands dirty.

11
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:49.460
What you think these little toys of yours can beat me? So eager to declare victory. Are you just terrified you won't get the chance to talk big after you lose in three months?

12
00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:53.460
Keep acting tough. In three months we'll see what you've really got. Roman, we're leaving.
